  {
   "bundle": "restobundle/pages/seaareaislandpage.ab",
   "path_id": -7949323044511066023,
   "gameobject": "Text",
   "zh": "野外分为安全区域、中立区域、对战区域：域中玩家间不可进行PK；自由区域中战争模式的玩家可以攻击其他玩家，且会触发红名机制；战争区域中所有玩家相遇均进入战斗，但红。战争模式的玩家攻击和平模式的玩家，如果和平玩家获胜，和平玩家不会变为红名。任何模式的玩家，击杀已红名的玩家，均不会变为红名。杀人数达到一定数量时，会被强制遣送至监狱。\n·恢复生命：野外战斗后，生命值被保留。需要使用恢复道具或前往医生NPC处回血。\n·野外阵亡后，可以选择道具原地复活，不选择原地复活默认会在安全区复活。\n·玩家可以手动设置自己的战斗模式：和平模式、战争模式，战争模式会攻击其他玩家，和平模式不会攻击其他玩家。\n·野外分为安全区域、中立区域、对战区域：安全区域中玩家间不可进行PK；自由区域中战争模式的玩家可以攻击其他玩家，且会触发红名机制；战争区域中所有玩家相遇均进入战斗，但不触发红名机制。\n·红名机制:在自由区域中，开启战争模式的玩家，击杀其他玩家后名字会逐渐变红。战争模式的玩家攻击和平模式的玩家，如果和平玩家获胜，和平玩家不会变为红名。任何模式的玩家，击杀已红名的玩家，均不会变为红名。杀人数达到一定数量时，会被强制遣送至监狱。\n·恢复生命：野外战斗后，生命值被保留。需要使用恢复道具或前往医生NPC处回血。\n·野外阵亡后，可以选择道具原地复活，不选择原地复活默认会在安全区复活。",
   "en": "The field has Safe, Neutral and Combat zones: players can't PK in zone; in Free zones, players in War Mode can attack other players and trigger the red name system; in War zones, all players who meet enter battle, but red. When a War Mode player attacks a Peace Mode player and the Peace Mode player wins, the Peace Mode player doesn't get a red name. Players in any mode who defeat a red-named player don't get a red name. Players who reach a certain number of kills are forcibly sent to prison.\n· HP recovery: HP is kept after field battles. Use recovery items or visit a Doctor NPC to heal.\n· If you fall in the field, you can use an item to revive on the spot; otherwise you revive in the Safe zone by default.\n· Players can set their battle mode manually: Peace Mode or War Mode. War Mode attacks other players; Peace Mode doesn't.\n· The field has Safe, Neutral and Combat zones: players can't PK in Safe zones; in Free zones, players in War Mode can attack other players and trigger the red name system; in War zones, all players who meet enter battle, but the red name system isn't triggered.\n· Red name system: in Free zones, players with War Mode on gradually get a red name after defeating other players. When a War Mode player attacks a Peace Mode player and the Peace Mode player wins, the Peace Mode player doesn't get a red name. Players in any mode who defeat a red-named player don't get a red name. Players who reach a certain number of kills are forcibly sent to prison.\n· HP recovery: HP is kept after field battles. Use recovery items or visit a Doctor NPC to heal.\n· If you fall in the field, you can use an item to revive on the spot; otherwise you revive in the Safe zone by default."
  },
